    "timestamp_safety_finding": "Gross private issuance (total_accepted - soma_accepted) for auctions with auction_date <= t - 1, scheduled total maturing par from prior auctions (maturity_date == t), and buybacks with operation_date <= t - 1 are strictly provable as-of (t - 1, 17:00 ET). Exact SOMA holdings at maturity of older CUSIPs altered by intervening secondary-market QE/QT purchases cannot be reconstructed from auctions_query soma_accepted alone without CUSIP-level weekly SOMA snapshots aligned to Thursday release timestamps; therefore Stage 1 specifies a strictly timestamp-safe gross-private-minus-scheduled-maturing-par-minus-buybacks net supply benchmark (plus separate gross private coupon issuance) and discloses the exact SOMA-at-maturity limitation."
  },
